{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2021b.q29.material.recovered", "text": "一位少年，酷爱小提琴，却为不能成名而苦恼。老琴师把少年带到自家的花园里说：“世上有两种花，一种花能结果，一种花不能结果，不能结果的花更加美丽，它们在阳光下开放，没有目的，只为快乐，快乐本身就是成功啊！”少年时深受触动，他仍然常拉小提琴，但不再求成名。这位少年叫爱因斯坦。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "701ef49dac48b18f0ef6e08340bb528b5266ad886582616cc3e5e00a768622cf", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 5449, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5584, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "701ef49dac48b18f0ef6e08340bb528b5266ad886582616cc3e5e00a768622cf"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2021b.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m5.k4"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2021b.q29"], "word_count": 135, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "701ef49dac48b18f0ef6e08340bb528b5266ad886582616cc3e5e00a768622cf", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 5449, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5584, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《综合素质》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "701ef49dac48b18f0ef6e08340bb528b5266ad886582616cc3e5e00a768622cf"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown",